<description>&lt;p&gt;Rebel forces and government troops continue fighting near the Uganda border, killing one combatant and wounding three, while UNMISS patrols protect civilians in Greater Tonj. Communal violence in Gbudwe has forced 15,000 civilians to flee and 16 community leaders have been detained amid renewed Bor clashes. A drone strike on a market in the disputed Abyei region killed 73 people, according to Addis Standard. IGAD is probing attacks in Bentiu and peace talks have been launched in Tonj East. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFB4SXpQUU5XeFZLSmtvU2NzZWVwNHFXQmhNd3F2T0wzZ1pFZnBhUjNTUm9DMExfOWlTalZKRzBycG5uWUUyTHEwWVNWc0REWnhpRXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1rSGxLek5XZzAwdlFXcUpyU1Q3X3dVbS0tQkJBMC1pTkdxcFhZalN2YXcwSV8tQ05iaGZSRVB6UVhzakpqMkhvSnQ2ODVPajVKMUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOY3hWWEhnSEQwRnBnalFCVHpyRzk3QlhMNzUtWlVDZmY2M2M0VDlSSnFvNW5hb253aXNkT2hEM0xET19QeWU5SkV6cmxSc19uNFQxcFc5TV8tNVBET1c3bkFlRktqNUQ3VWZMVTA0VHlsSzkzOC16czQ1RXdxYnp6U2NQNlcwYUpF?oc=5&quot;&gt;조선일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxON3VmS1doLVpDWU5SUDlBY3VCbWdZUzZYUWtlZmM1MHUyYU8zWHpZYmFzXzZlVEphN0JyRTZrZjZnU0RROTBZMVpxSzNfdFBXYXdLaUo3TVd1YWstVGlQdXhEYTlNTGJoWExzb1pJaHJWQWJKMENGbU94ZzUtbjhJQnhPSVAtY0dhdnpsaklYcE1qTkhrZXVjdHhNQWlsMDJnYkpGcXJ6RVpOSkFtclNFLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Uganda Radionetwork&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTFBCVC1IY1ZINnV3d0ZvVUp